# Normalise line endings: LF in the repo, native on checkout for text,
# except shell scripts (must stay LF to run on Linux/macOS/WSL) and
# Windows batch files (cmd.exe wants CRLF).
* text=auto
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.py  text
*.md  text
*.toml text
*.yml text
*.txt text

# Binary media
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
